    "the acceptance cases for the sequence builder. Seed them with:",
    "node test/seed-examples.js [baseUrl]",
    "",
    "Customer Example 1: typed login with password, three login allocation codes",
    "(list, list, barcode), then two products: search, select, quantity, take;",
    "search, select, take. \"Info window enter quantity\" is the quantity screen.",
    "Customer Example 2: a product kit with items from various locations: one",
    "search and select, then \"open pocket lid, take item, close lid\" four times.",
    "Customer Example 3: RFID login, the same three allocation codes, and a lot",
    "managed product whose information window shows its lot number.",
    "",
    "His lists name no products, search terms, codes or text, so those are",
    "chosen from shared/catalogue.js and the phase 1 screens. Name, part number,",
    "quantity, unit of issue, device type, menu number and door code all come from",
    "the catalogue, the way the real screens derive them."
